@startuml
title DeliveryApp - C4 Container
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Customer / Courier / Store / Admin" as User

rectangle "DeliveryApp System" {
  rectangle "DeliveryApp.Api\n(ASP.NET Core Minimal API)" as Api
  rectangle "Application Services\n(Order/Catalog/Customer/Courier/Payment/Review)" as Service
  rectangle "DeliveryApp.Application\n(Contracts, DTOs, Interfaces)" as Application
  rectangle "DeliveryApp.Infrastructure\n(EF Core + Specialized Repositories)" as Infrastructure
  database "SQL Server (DeliveryAppDb)" as SqlDb
}

User --> Api : HTTPS JSON
Api --> Service : command/query calls
Service --> Application : DTOs + interfaces
Service --> Infrastructure : repository abstractions
Infrastructure --> SqlDb : EF Core + SQL

note bottom of Api
Endpoints:
- /api/orders
- /api/stores
- /api/couriers/available
- /api/orders/{id}/payments
- /api/orders/{id}/assign-courier
- /api/modules/*
end note

@enduml
